<section class="section problem" aria-labelledby="problem-h">
  <div class="container problem__inner">
    <p class="eyebrow" data-reveal>THE GAP</p>
    <h2 id="problem-h" data-reveal>Everyone rebuilds the MUSD Trove layer by hand.</h2>
    <p class="prose problem__body" data-reveal>
      MUSD is a Liquity-style CDP: opening a loan means computing insertion hints, getting the borrowing fee and gas
      reserve exactly right, and reading interest that accrues by the second. Mezo connects the wallet — but leaves you
      to wire all of that yourself. So every team rebuilds the same fragile plumbing: prediction-market and payment apps
      alike hand-roll borrowing-power math, health factors, and the hint dance, each with their own subtle bugs.
    </p>
    <p class="problem__kicker" data-reveal>
      musd-kit does it once, correctly — and proves it against Mezo's own contracts.
    </p>
  </div>
</section>

